              "tags": { "discipline": 2, "severity": 2, "gevurah_signal": 2, "ambition": 1 } },
            { "key": "B", "text": "Your mercy. You learned early that kindness at the wrong moment costs more.",
              "tags": { "severity": 2, "gevurah_signal": 2, "sorrow": 1 } },
            { "key": "C", "text": "Your past. Whatever happened, happened. You don't carry it in your grip anymore.",
              "tags": { "discipline": 1, "independence": 2, "gevurah_signal": 1, "sorrow": 1 } },
            { "key": "D", "text": "Your dependencies. You'd rather lose people than owe them.",
